msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
"Fuse (the Free Unix Spectrum Emulator) was originally a ZX Spectrum emulator "
"for Unix. It has since been ported to Mac OS X, Windows, the Wii, AmigaOS "
"and MorphOS."
msgstr "Fuse (Free Unix Spectrum Emulator) var ursprungligen en ZX Spectrum-emulator för Unix. Den har sedan dess portats till Mac OS X, Windows, Wii, AmigaOS och MorphOS."

